  "description": "In this moreish meal, tender tofu, springy egg noodles and vibrant green veg happily soak up the sweet, savoury and zingy Asian-inspired flavours. The creaminess from the sesame dressing and crunch from the peanuts add the finishing touches. Unfortunately, this week's egg noodles was in short supply, so we've replaced it with udon noodles. Don't worry, the recipe will be just as delicious!",
