  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Using your hands, crumble firm tofu into bite-sized pieces (don't worry if they crumble smaller!). Set aside.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook green veg mix, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632112c3dc7a976f4e0dae1d/step-ac8f3847.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are cooking, half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook udon noodles over medium-high heat until tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• In the last minute of cook time, gently stir noodles with a fork to separate.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632112c3dc7a976f4e0dae1d/step-cff0f68d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, tossing occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and ginger paste and cook, tossing, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add sweet chilli sauce, the soy sauce, a splash of water, noodles and veggies. Toss to combine and cook until slightly reduced, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632112c3dc7a976f4e0dae1d/step-2a480403.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide crumbled tofu and udon noodles with veggies between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts and serve with sesame dressing. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632112c3dc7a976f4e0dae1d/step-5d80c3b7.jpg"
    }
  ]
